> Center\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"text-xl mb-8 leading-relaxed text-blue-50\">\n                    Premium <b>air conditioner repair</b> for residences, industrial GIDCs, and coastal hubs across Valsad and Vapi. <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides expert technical care for all multi-brand cooling systems.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full flex items-center shadow-lg transition duration-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.888 11.888-11.888 3.176 0 6.161 1.237 8.404 3.48s3.481 5.229 3.481 8.404c0 6.556-5.332 11.888-11.888 11.888-2.013 0-3.987-.512-5.735-1.483l-6.249 1.708zm6.303-4.463c1.554.92 3.402 1.403 5.284 1.403 5.614 0 10.185-4.571 10.185-10.185 0-2.719-1.059-5.277-2.983-7.201s-4.482-2.983-7.202-2.983c-5.614 0-10.185 4.571-10.185 10.185 0 1.957.561 3.864 1.623 5.513l-1.066 3.89 3.987-1.091z\"/></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Valsad Team\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-yellow-500 transition duration-300\">\n                        View Price List\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 flex justify-center\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Atlas-aircon-vehicle.webp\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon AC Repair Valsad Service Fleet\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-8 border-yellow-400 transform rotate-2\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase tracking-wide\">Why Choose <b>Atlas Aircon</b> for AC Repair in Valsad</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-orange-700\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-yellow-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        Valsad Service Benefits\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li><b>Regional reach</b> serving Valsad town, Vapi GIDC, and Umbergaon.</li>\n                        <li><b>Skilled technicians</b> specialized in anti-corrosive coastal treatments.</li>\n                        <li>Use of <b>genuine copper pipes</b> to combat the humid South Gujarat air.</li>\n                        <li><b>Transparent billing</b> with competitive regional pricing.</li>\n                        <li><b>Rapid response</b> for emergency breakdowns in industrial chemical zones.</li>\n                        <li><b>Expert maintenance</b> for high-capacity chillers and panel ACs.</li>\n                        <li><b>Reliable warranty</b> on all PCB fixes and component replacements.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-orange-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-blue-900\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-orange-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n                        AC Performance Risks\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>Humid coastal air leads to <b>rapid copper coil rusting</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Industrial soot causes <b>heavy outdoor unit clogging</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Power variations lead to <b>frequent inverter PCB failures</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Duplicate spares result in <b>unreliable system operation</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Clogged filters reduce <b>indoor cooling efficiency</b> significantly.</li>\n                        <li>Ignoring minor leaks leads to <b>catastrophic compressor failure</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Skipping service results in <b>unpredictable electricity bills</b>.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SPECIAL SECTION: VAPI, SARIGAM, UMBERGAON, PARDI, DHARAMPUR -->\n    <section class=\"py-20 special-zone-section text-white relative\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-900 bg-opacity-90 p-10 rounded-3xl border-2 border-yellow-400 shadow-2xl\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-8 text-yellow-400 uppercase text-center\">Exclusive AC Support: Valsad Industrial &#038; Hilly Zones</h2>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Vapi GIDC Hub</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Dedicated <b>chiller repair</b> and heavy industrial HVAC maintenance for chemical and pharma giants in Vapi.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Sarigam &#038; Umbergaon</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Specialized <b>panel ac service</b> and centralized cooling for manufacturing plants in the border industrial zones.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Pardi Industrial Area</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Fast <b>split ac repair</b> and master cleaning for the growing industrial and residential clusters in Pardi.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Dharampur Hilly Belt</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Mobile <b>ac service center</b> support for residences and government institutions in the Dharampur hilly region.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700 lg:col-span-2 text-center flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Coastal Corrosion Protection</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">We provide specialized anti-rust coatings and high-grade <b>ac gas charging</b> to protect units in high-humidity areas near Tithal Beach.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 text-center\">\n                    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-yellow-500 transition shadow-lg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request Priority Industrial Visit</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Valsad Product Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-blue-900\">Which Types of Products We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">Total cooling maintenance for residential, hotel, and industrial sectors in Valsad.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Window-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Window AC Repair Valsad\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/window-ac-service-valsad\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Window AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Full <b>window ac repair</b> including gas refill and motor work.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/window-ac-service-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Valsad</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/chiller-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Chiller Repair Valsad\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-valsad\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Chiller Repair</a></h4>\n             