Repair Price List Valsad</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border-t-8 border-orange-500\">\n                <table class=\"min-w-full leading-normal\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-900 text-yellow-400\">\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Valsad Service Detail</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Starting Rate</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Split AC Jet Wash (Valsad)</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹599</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Gas Refilling (Valsad &#038; Vapi)</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹2500</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Inverter PCB Repair</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹1500</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"/remote/\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">AC Remote</a>\n                <a href=\"/capacitor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">AC Capacitor</a>\n                <a href=\"/compressor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Compressor Fix</a>\n                <a href=\"/indoor-motor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Indoor Motor</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Valsad Local Areas -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-blue-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-yellow-400\">Areas We Serve in Valsad District</h2>\n            <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Residential &#038; Hilly Towns</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Tithal Road</span> <span>Abrama</span> <span>Dharampur Road</span> <span>Mograwadi</span> <span>Valsad Town</span> <span>Halar</span>\n                    <span>Pardi Town</span> <span>Dharampur</span> <span>Umbergaon Town</span> <span>Khergam</span> <span>Kaprada</span> <span>Atul</span>\n                    <span>Motiwada</span> <span>Bhagdawada</span> <span>Nanakwada</span> <span>Dungri</span> <span>Gundlav</span> <span>Vapi Town</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Industrial &#038; Coastal Hubs</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Vapi GIDC</span> <span>Sarigam GIDC</span> <span>Umbergaon GIDC</span> <span>Pardi Industrial Estate</span>\n                    <span>Gundlav Industrial</span> <span>Atul Industrial</span> <span>Sanjan Industrial Area</span> <span>Bhilad Industrial</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Valsad FAQs -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-blue-900\">Valsad Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the cost of split AC service in Valsad?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A professional <b>ac jet service</b> in Valsad starts from ₹599. We use high-pressure pumps to ensure thorough coil cleaning and dust removal.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you provide AC repair in Vapi GIDC?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we have a specialized team for <b>heavy-duty ac repair</b> and HVAC maintenance serving all factories and offices in Vapi GIDC and Sarigam.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you fix central AC for industrial plants in Umbergaon?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Absolutely. <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides specialized <b>chiller repair services</b> and industrial <b>hvac maintenance</b> for manufacturing units in Umbergaon.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What brands of AC do you repair in Valsad?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer <b>multi-brand ac repair</b> for all leading names including LG, Samsung, Daikin, Blue Star, Voltas, Hitachi, and Carrier.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Is gas charging available for cassette ACs in Vapi?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>ac gas charging</b> for all systems including cassette units and split ACs using R32, R410, and R22 refrigerants.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you offer repair for inverter PCB boards in Valsad?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our technicians are experts in <b>inverter pcb repair</b>, ensuring your advanced cooling system is restored without a full board replacement.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How long does a master AC service take in Valsad?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A comprehensive <b>ac jet wash service</b> usually takes between 45 to 90 minutes per unit to ensure thorough salt and dust removal.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you use original copper pipes for repairs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we strictly use high-grade <b>genuine copper pipe for ac</b> and recommend anti-corrosion treatments for units near Tithal Beach.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the warranty on spare parts in Valsad?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer a <b>service warranty</b> on labor and a standard manufacturer-backed duration warranty on all genuine <b>ac spare parts</b> replaced.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How can I book an Atlas Aircon technician?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Booking is easy. Click the <b>WhatsApp button</b> on our banner or call our Valsad service desk at <b>+91 97272 57141</b>.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white py-12 border-t-4 border-yellow-400\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n   